+/* PS3RECOMP_VK_MEMPOOL=1: image memory from size-class free lists. The
+ * engine makes and drops images every frame -- a snapshot at the dynamic
+ * resolution, which changes from frame to frame (split-screen: 30-55 a
+ * frame, ~4 ms of vkAllocateMemory/vkFreeMemory each 10). A block is the
+ * request rounded up to a power of two (256 KB at least); a freed one -- its
