+/* The MFC parameter channels a DMA writes before its command (MFC_LSA,
+ * MFC_EAH, MFC_EAL, MFC_Size, MFC_TagID) only latch a value into the
+ * context: done inline where the channel is a constant, which it is in
+ * lifted code, instead of a call into spu_wrch per parameter (five per DMA).
