+ * g_spu_coh_bitmap (spu_coherency.c: one bit per 128-byte line, zero until an
+ * SPU reserves a line, bits set before the reserving SPU's process-wide
+ * barrier), before and after it lands: no pointer to load, no NULL test. The
+ * store probes armed by SPU_ATOM_EA and PS3_NULL_SWEEP clear vm_inline_ok
+ * (span 0), so the inline store does not test for them. */
+#define PPU_FAST_MM 1
